#. では、今回は苗木誠殿に、
#. 拙者の伝説を聞かせてしんぜよう！
msgctxt "0001 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Now then! This time, would you like to learn about one\n"
"of my many legends?"
msgstr ""

#. …伝説？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Your legends...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>“超高校級の同人作家”<CLT>ともなれば、
#. いくつもの伝説を持っている訳ですよ。
msgctxt "0003 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Naturally! You don't become the <CLT 3>Ultimate Fanfic\n"
"Creator<CLT> without a few legends sprouting up around you!"
msgstr ""

#. 中学の時、部活動として、
#. 学校側に“同人部”を作らせた伝説とかね！
msgctxt "0004 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"One such legend is how, in middle school, I was able\n"
"to convince the school to create a fanfic club!"
msgstr ""

#. 中学時代から正々堂々と同人誌作る俺！
#. 鬼畜キタコレ！
msgctxt "0005 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"And from that day, I exposed myself and my fanfic to\n"
"the world at large!"
msgstr ""

#. ちなみに、そんな僕の二次創作の対象となる作品…
#. なんだか知っています？
msgctxt "0006 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"By the way, do you happen to know what all my work is\n"
"based on?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、さっぱりだけど…
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sorry, no idea..."
msgstr ""

#. ご存知、絶賛放映中のアニメ！
#. <CLT 3>外道天使☆もちもちプリンセス<CLT>です！！
msgctxt "0008 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Well, surely you've heard of the highly acclaimed\n"
"anime <CLT 3>Demon Angel☆Pretty Pudgy Princess<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. いや…ベタだとお思いかもしれませんがね…
#. それは違うんですよ、と。
msgctxt "0009 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Now, you might think that that sounds totally cliche,\n"
"but you would be WRONG!"
msgstr ""

#. ボクの場合は、美少女アニメとしてのぶー子ではなく、
#. メタサイエンスフィクション作品として捉えてて…
msgctxt "0010 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"I didn't simply copy the \"pretty girl\" Princess\n"
"Piggles style. I took a total meta sci-fi approach!"
msgstr ""

#. ボクはそういった視点を持っている変わり者なのです。
#. それに、そうやって見るとですね…
msgctxt "0011 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"My perspective was seen as quite odd, of course, but\n"
"if you really look at what I was doing..."
msgstr ""

#. ぶー子は、いわゆる“ＳＦニューウェーブ運動”への
#. アンチテーゼではないかと…
msgctxt "0012 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"...my version of Princess Piggles was the total\n"
"antithesis of the new-wave sci-fi movement."
msgstr ""

#. Ｊ・Ｇ・バラードのスペキュラティブ・フィクション
#. への回答とも取れる表現が随所に見受けられ…
msgctxt "0013 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"In fact, it was my response to J.G. Ballard's\n"
"speculative fiction stylings!"
msgstr ""

#. ぶふぉ！　ついマニアックな知識が出てしまいました！
#. いや、失敬ですた！！
msgctxt "0014 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Buwheh! Ahh, my geekdom is leaking out again. I\n"
"apologize!"
msgstr ""

#. とにかく、僕はその辺の連中と違って、
#. 萌えアニメとしてぶー子を見ている訳ではないのです。
msgctxt "0015 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Anyway, unlike most fans, I never saw Princess Piggles\n"
"as your typical moe anime."
msgstr ""

#. そっか…それはわかったよ…
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, I definitely got that impression..."
msgstr ""

#. それに、山田クンの行動力もね。
#. 学校に認めさせて、部まで作らせるなんてさ…
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But I can't believe you were able to single-handedly\n"
"persuade the school to let you make a club..."
msgstr ""

#. 売上金で教師どもを買収しましたからね…
msgctxt "0018 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Oh, that's because I bribed them with a cut of my\n"
"profits."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ば、買収…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Profits...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 行動力って意味では、最近の僕はすごいですぞ。
#. 実に精力的ですぞ。
msgctxt "0020 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "And I've only gotten better at it! I'm blowin' up!"
msgstr ""

#. 今までは、ぶー子のオンリージャンル系イベント
#. ばっかりの参加でしたが…
msgctxt "0021 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Now then, up till now, I've always focused on taking\n"
"part in Princess Piggles single-setting events."
msgstr ""

#. …<CLT 3>オンリージャンル<CLT>？
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "<CLT 3>Single-setting<CLT>...?"
msgstr ""

#. サークルの活動内容や活動ジャンルを限定した
#. イベントの事をそう呼ぶのです。
msgctxt "0023 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"It's when a circle gets together to come up with a\n"
"project or event focused on only one show or series."
msgstr ""

#. 例えば、ぶー子オンリーイベント…
#. といった具合ですな。
msgctxt "0024 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"So a Princess Piggles single-setting event would only\n"
"allow works involving Princess Piggles, see?"
msgstr ""

#. 逆に、ジャンルを制限しないものに関しては、
#. 何系イベントと呼ぶかご存知ですかな？
msgctxt "0025 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"On the flipside, if there's no restriction on the\n"
"number of properties, do you know what that's called?"
msgstr ""

#. オールジャンル
msgctxt "0026 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Free-for-all"
msgstr ""

#. スペシャルイベント
msgctxt "0027 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Special event"
msgstr ""

#. うーん…ジャンルを限定しないってことは
#. 規模も大きそうだし…
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Hmm... If there's no limit or whatever, it'd have to\n"
"be a pretty large-scale kinda thing."
msgstr ""

#. スペシャルイベント、とか？
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So is it...a special event?"
msgstr ""

#. はぁ…
#. なんという残念な発想…
msgctxt "0030 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "*Sigh* What a boring, disappointing, wrong answer."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>え…
#. なんだか、がっかりされてる？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Uh...that seems like an overreaction...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. オンリーの逆！
#. といえばもう答えたも同然ですがな！
msgctxt "0032 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"It's the opposite of a single-setting style, right?\n"
"That should be enough of a hint!"
msgstr ""

#. なんとかマーケット
msgctxt "0033 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Fan jam"
msgstr ""

#. ええっと、なんとかマーケットとかいう名前を
#. 聞いた事があるけど、それ？
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Uhh...is it like, a fan jam or something?"
msgstr ""

#. くうっ！　これだから素人はッ！
msgctxt "0035 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Kh! This is why I hate newbies..."
msgstr ""

#. それは、とある海辺の大規模イベント、
#. その固有名です！
msgctxt "0036 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you're thinking of game jams, which, while\n"
"interesting, are indie dev-specific!"
msgstr ""

#. そこのところ、
#. 勘違いしないようにお願いしますぞ！
msgctxt "0037 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Get it right, or pay the price!"
msgstr ""

#. わ、わかったよ…
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木誠殿…
#. 難しく考えなくてもいいのですぞ？
msgctxt "0039 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "You should probably take this seriously, Mr. Naegi."
msgstr ""

#. ジャンルを限定したイベントがオンリー…
#. その逆だと考えればよいのです。
msgctxt "0040 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "What would be the opposite of a single-setting event?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>活動内容や活動ジャンルを限定したイベントが
#. オンリーイベント…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A single-setting event only allows material from\n"
"one show or series...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その逆で、ジャンルを限定しない
#. イベントのことなんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And the opposite of that is when anything is allowed\n"
"from any property...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. オンリージャンルの逆だから…
#. <CLT 3>オールジャンル<CLT>とか？
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The opposite of the single-setting event... Is it just\n"
"called a <CLT 3>free-for-all<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. その通りでございます！！
msgctxt "0044 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "That's absolutely right!"
msgstr ""

#. オールジャンル系はデカいイベントも多いのですが、
#. その反面ですかね…
msgctxt "0045 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"There are actually plenty of free-for-all events every\n"
"year, and yet..."
msgstr ""

#. 最近は、同人の意味もわかってないハンパ者が多くて、
#. 苛立つ事も多数ですわ！
msgctxt "0046 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"More and more slackers are showing up with no idea\n"
"what fanfic really means! It's so ANNOYING!"
msgstr ""

#. そういう勘違い連中を全力で叩き潰す為に、
#. 僕もオールジャンル系に参加を決意したのです！
msgctxt "0047 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"So in order to crush these peons with all my might,\n"
"I'm going to start taking part in more free-for-alls!"
msgstr ""

#. た、叩き潰すって…
#. なんだか穏やかじゃないけど…
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Crush them...? That doesn't sound very friendly..."
msgstr ""

#. 馴れ合いでイベントに参加してる訳じゃないんで…
#. 中途半端な連中は許せないのです。
msgctxt "0049 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"I don't participate in these events to make friends!\n"
"And I cannot forgive those lazy bastards!"
msgstr ""

#. それに、小物だからと言って放置しておいて、
#. 後で後悔しても遅いですからね。
msgctxt "0050 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"And don't tell me to ignore them! If you let some\n"
"little wimp survive, you'll regret it later!"
msgstr ""

#. ＲＰＧの魔王も、勇者がレベル１の時点で、
#. 手を打っておかないから、やられてしまうのです！
msgctxt "0051 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Play any RPG where the villain spares the hero when\n"
"he's level 1, and what happens? Boom! Dead!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんか、わかるような…
#. わからないような…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I...kinda get it. But I kinda don't...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 修羅しか生き残れぬ厳しい世界…
#. それが、この業界なのですよ。
msgctxt "0053 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"It's a dog-eat-dog industry, where only the most\n"
"brutal survive."
msgstr ""

#. ですが安心してください。苗木誠殿には
#. 最初は<CLT 3>コスプレ参加者<CLT>として参加してもらうので！
msgctxt "0054 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Oh, but don't worry. I'm gonna start you off easy by\n"
"getting you involved in some simple <CLT 3>cosplay action<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. え？　ボクが参加？
#. て言うか、コスプレ！？
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Huh? I'm gonna get involved? ...Wait, did you say\n"
"cosplay!?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木誠殿はヴィジュアルもそこそこですし、
#. クオリティー次第では売り子で雇ってあげましょうか？
msgctxt "0056 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"You're a pretty good-looking guy. If your costume was\n"
"decent enough, I might even let you work my booth!"
msgstr ""

#. フヒヒ…腐女子連中も取り込める…
msgctxt "0057 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Bwehehe... I bet you could even net yourself a magical\n"
"girl harem!"
msgstr ""

#. という訳で、一緒に同人界を変えましょう！
msgctxt "0058 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"So with that in mind, let's change the world of fanfic\n"
"together!"
msgstr ""

#. …どういう訳？
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...What does that even mean?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>山田一二三の<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0060 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Hifumi's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with him.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. <CLT><CLT 3>“スキルポイント”<CLT><CLT 23>が上がりました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0061 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Your maximum number of <CLT><CLT 3>Skill Points<CLT><CLT 23> has increased!\n"
"Hey, look at you go!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは逃げるようにして山田クンと別れ、
#. 自分の部屋へと帰った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I probably looked like I was running away as I went\n"
"back to my room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
